# Phase 6: CI/CD Pipeline - Complete Review

## Overview

You've built a **3-workflow CI/CD system** that automates infrastructure deployment using GitHub Actions and Terraform.

This is a **production-grade pipeline** used by real companies. Let's understand every part.

---

## The Big Picture

```
YOUR CODE
   ↓
GITHUB (where code lives)
   ↓
GITHUB ACTIONS (the automation engine)
   ↓
AWS (where infrastructure lives)
```

**The pipeline automatically:**
1. Checks your code (plan.yml)
2. Deploys changes (apply.yml)
3. Cleans up when needed (destroy.yml)

