## Common Questions Answered

**Q: What happens if terraform plan fails?**
A: PR gets ❌ status, merge is blocked, you must fix the code

**Q: What if I merge bad code to main?**
A: apply.yml still waits for approval, you can review before applying

**Q: Can I skip the approval gate?**
A: No, it's a GitHub protection that requires human approval

**Q: What if terraform apply fails halfway?**
A: State file records what was applied, manual fix may be needed

**Q: How do I rollback a deployment?**
A: Revert the code commit, merge to main, apply the old state

**Q: What's in example.tfvars?**
A: Same values as terraform.tfvars, safe to commit to git

**Q: Why is -lock=false used?**
A: Plan doesn't modify state, so locking isn't needed

